  "description": "Powerful support and extra space for bigger jobs.\nCombining Shimano's EP801 drive system with the extended Bullitt X platform, this is a bike built for riders who regularly carry larger loads and need the capacity to match. Fast motor response and plenty of torque make heavy cargo, steep hills and long working days easier to manage.\nThe longer platform provides up to 400 litres of cargo volume, opening up possibilities for larger deliveries, bulky equipment and custom cargo solutions. Despite the added capacity, it still rides with the direct handling and agility that Bullitt riders expect.\nAvailable with both internal and external gearing options, it's a dependable workhorse for professionals who need both power and space in equal measure.",
